                "id": "1986203852794671223",
                "in_reply_to_post_id": null,
                "in_reply_to_profile_id": null,
                "in_reply_to_profile_username": null,
                "place_country_code": null,
                "place_country_name": null,
                "place_full_name": null,
                "place_type": null,
                "poll": null,
                "post_type": "post",
                "quote_count": 0,
                "quoted_status_id": null,
                "quoted_status_profile_id": null,
                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "\ud83e\uddf5As America endures the longest government shutdown in U.S. history, we heard directly from constituents who rely on the Affordable Care Act (ACA) Marketplace for their healthcare. They shared serious concerns about rising premiums and uncertainty as Congress continues to debate the future of healthcare.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
                "text_tagged_users_ids": null,
                "text_tags": null,
                "timestamp": 1762382875,
                "view_count": 292
            },
            {
                "attached_links_expanded_url": null,
                "attached_links_url": null,
                "attached_medias_preview_url": null,
                "attached_medias_url": null,
                "attached_videos": null,
                "author_id": "1610323296360210433",
                "author_username": "RepDonDavis",
                "community_notes": null,
                "conversation_id": "1986203852794671223",
                "created_time": "2025-11-05T22:47:55",
                "favorite_count": 0,
                "geo_lat": null,
                "geo_lon": null,
                "id": "1986203855592329479",
                "in_reply_to_post_id": "1986203852794671223",
                "in_reply_to_profile_id": "1610323296360210433",
                "in_reply_to_profile_username": "RepDonDavis",
                "place_country_code": null,
                "place_country_name": null,
                "place_full_name": null,
                "place_type": null,
                "poll": null,
                "post_type": "reply",
                "quote_count": 0,
                "quoted_status_id": null,
                "quoted_status_profile_id": null,
                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "All constituents indicated that their premiums had at least doubled. One constituent shared that his payment for a 2005 model car is $250, and his monthly healthcare premium increase is about three times his car payment. The new increase is the difference between him being able to replace his car or not.\u00a0He also shared that he is not saving money for his kids' college or for retirement. Another constituent said that her health insurance would go up to $27,000 a year, which, at her age, is a significant burden because she has a lot of expensive medications.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
                "text_tagged_users_ids": null,
                "text_tags": null,
                "timestamp": 1762382875,
                "view_count": 23
            },
            {
                "attached_links_expanded_url": null,
                "attached_links_url": null,
                "attached_medias_preview_url": null,
                "attached_medias_url": null,
                "attached_videos": null,
                "author_id": "1610323296360210433",
                "author_username": "RepDonDavis",
                "community_notes": null,
                "conversation_id": "1986203852794671223",
                "created_time": "2025-11-05T22:47:56",
                "favorite_count": 0,
                "geo_lat": null,
                "geo_lon": null,
                "id": "1986203858159178191",
                "in_reply_to_post_id": "1986203855592329479",
                "in_reply_to_profile_id": "1610323296360210433",
                "in_reply_to_profile_username": "RepDonDavis",
                "place_country_code": null,
                "place_country_name": null,
                "place_full_name": null,
                "place_type": null,
                "poll": null,
                "post_type": "reply",
                "quote_count": 0,
                "quoted_status_id": null,
                "quoted_status_profile_id": null,
                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Constituents are waiting in a holding pattern, uncertain about the future, hoping that Congress will resolve the issue before they purchase their insurance.\u00a0Many respondents indicated that either they or a family member had received specialized medical care. They concluded that alternatives included possibly switching doctors, choosing a different plan, reducing other expenses to maintain their coverage, or forgoing coverage altogether. Some mentioned taking out a home equity line of credit. Others indicated taking on additional employment or delving into 401(k) accounts to accommodate their healthcare needs, realizing that at retirement, their savings would likely be depleted. Another constituent shared that he needed to find money from somewhere because he didn't know where it would come from at this time.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
                "text_tagged_users_ids": null,
                "text_tags": null,
                "timestamp": 1762382876,
                "view_count": 22
            },
            {
                "attached_links_expanded_url": null,
                "attached_links_url": null,
                "attached_medias_preview_url": null,
                "attached_medias_url": null,
                "attached_videos": null,
                "author_id": "1610323296360210433",
                "author_username": "RepDonDavis",
                "community_notes": null,
                "conversation_id": "1986203852794671223",
                "created_time": "2025-11-05T22:47:56",
                "favorite_count": 0,
                "geo_lat": null,
                "geo_lon": null,
                "id": "1986203860717703210",
                "in_reply_to_post_id": "1986203858159178191",
                "in_reply_to_profile_id": "1610323296360210433",
                "in_reply_to_profile_username": "RepDonDavis",
                "place_country_code": null,
                "place_country_name": null,
                "place_full_name": null,
                "place_type": null,
                "poll": null,
                "post_type": "reply",
                "quote_count": 0,
                "quoted_status_id": null,
                "quoted_status_profile_id": null,
                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Overwhelmingly, constituents believed they had to have health insurance and expressed that they were being affected emotionally, including feelings of stress and depression. One mother said, \u201cI feel like crying.\u201d There were strong feelings of mistrust toward Washington, D.C. politicians, who many felt had left them behind and made them feel unheard. A constituent said, \u201cThis is not the America I have known,\u201d and another expressed that \u201cthey have no idea what this has done to our lives.\u201d",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
                "text_tagged_users_ids": null,
                "text_tags": null,
                "timestamp": 1762382876,
                "view_count": 22
            },
            {
                "attached_links_expanded_url": null,
                "attached_links_url": null,
                "attached_medias_preview_url": null,
                "attached_medias_url": null,
                "attached_videos": null,
                "author_id": "1610323296360210433",
                "author_username": "RepDonDavis",
                "community_notes": null,
                "conversation_id": "1986203852794671223",
                "created_time": "2025-11-05T22:47:57",
                "favorite_count": 0,
                "geo_lat": null,
                "geo_lon": null,
                "id": "1986203864308326664",
                "in_reply_to_post_id": "1986203860717703210",
                "in_reply_to_profile_id": "1610323296360210433",
                "in_reply_to_profile_username": "RepDonDavis",
                "place_country_code": null,
                "place_country_name": null,
                "place_full_name": null,
                "place_type": null,
                "poll": null,
                "post_type": "reply",
                "quote_count": 0,
                "quoted_status_id": null,
                "quoted_status_profile_id": null,
                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "A constituent shared that she never expected to use the ACA but now sees real value in having it. She also mentioned being approached about Medicaid, which surprised her given her 27 years of experience in the workforce.\n\nConstituents acknowledged that they were not only dealing with health insurance concerns, but also with the increasing cost of living.\u00a0We have to think about putting food on our tables or having health insurance. Many are raising children with their own medical challenges on top of the desire to pay for college for their children. There is a common belief that this will have a significant impact on our economy. A constituent said, \u201cIt kind of makes no sense whatsoever.\u201d",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
                "text_tagged_users_ids": null,
                "text_tags": null,
                "timestamp": 1762382877,
                "view_count": 231
            },
            {
                "attached_links_expanded_url": null,
                "attached_links_url": null,
                "attached_medias_preview_url": null,
                "attached_medias_url": null,
