                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "It\u2019s National Rural Health Day.\u2028Rural communities across eastern North Carolina face unique healthcare challenges: limited facilities, long travel distances, and financial instability. We must ensure that rural America is not left behind. https://t.co/tRcwKR5npp",
