                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Access to quality healthcare is essential for our communities. Fast Pace Health celebrated the opening of an impressive urgent care center in Henderson. It will enhance access to vital primary, urgent, and behavioral health services. https://t.co/C52HwQ71cn",
